    "answer": "Jakub has hands-on LLM API integration experience from the **DiagnoseMe** project. He integrated a language model through the **OpenAI API**, built prompts from structured user data, sent API requests, and used the responses in a desktop application. [1]\n\nFor APIs more broadly, his CV lists **REST API development**. His project work includes API integration in DiagnoseMe and a **FastAPI-based** portfolio project that is under development. [1] He also has experience with Azure SQL and Entity Framework Core in DiagnoseMe. [1]\n\nHe is currently developing an **AI Portfolio Assistant** whose planned architecture includes RAG, embeddings, vector search, and evaluation. These are explicitly described as planned rather than completed production features; he has begun preparing the project’s knowledge-base documents. [1][5] He identifies RAG, embeddings, and vector databases as areas he is still learning. [1]",
